          "In this final capstone synthesis, the Milestone 8 Engine undergoes rigorous verification against automated Hardware-in-the-Loop (HIL) stress testing and fault-injection matrices. The testbench exercises every edge failure mode: 1. Packet Loss & RF Shadowing: The multi-hop mesh simulator introduces 40% random packet drops and 30-second RF blackouts, verifying that Sparse-ACK selective retransmissions and local CBOR ring buffer caching operate with zero data loss.",
